# {{ project_name }}

This repository packages one Codex personal local marketplace into a Python
distribution. It starts without marketplace payload data.

## Add a marketplace payload

Import all plugins from a local marketplace:

```sh
poetry run python scripts/import_marketplace.py MARKETPLACE_NAME
```

Or import selected plugins:

```sh
poetry run python scripts/import_marketplace.py MARKETPLACE_NAME PLUGIN_NAME [...]
```

The resulting `resources/marketplace.json` and plugin directories are the
complete release payload. Build and install the distribution, then run:

```sh
{{ project_slug }} [--dry-run] [--force] [--json] [--verbose]
```
